<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="Quirky">
  <title>Quirky</title>
  <!--
    Drawn as geometry, not type. A favicon is its own document and gets no
    webfont, so a <text> Q would fall back to whatever the device has and
    change shape between machines.

    Colours are the site's own: the tile is the accent from the compiled-in
    theme and the letter is its page navy. Dark-on-bright rather than white-on
    -bright - 5.45:1 against 3.55:1 - which is what keeps the counter open at
    16px.
  -->
  <rect width="64" height="64" rx="14" fill="#F5436F"/>
  <circle cx="30" cy="29" r="15" fill="none" stroke="#070C22" stroke-width="7"/>
  <path d="M38.5 37.5 L47 46" stroke="#070C22" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
</svg>
